
.subckt astra_032_cmos_up_down_charge_pump vdd VSS iref dn up reset out
CP out VSS 20p
M1 iref iref VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=2u
M10 out reset VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M2 net1 iref VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=2u
M3 net1 net1 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=5u
M4 net2 net1 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=5u
M5 out upb net2 vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M6 out dn net0 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M7 net0 iref VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=2u
M8 upb up vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M9 upb up VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
RL out VSS 1G
.ends astra_032_cmos_up_down_charge_pump
